# Build artifacts should never be part of the EAS Build source upload —
# they're outputs, not inputs (2026-08-15, after a stray 3.5GB file in
# scripts/ pushed the archive past EAS's 2GB limit).
*.apk
*.aab
*.rar
*.zip
*.ipa

# Generated native folders and local env files never go to EAS
/android
/ios
.env*

# Privacy policy website — deployed separately, not part of app builds
/privacy-policy-page
